# CoffeeWorkshop — Line-ending policy
#
# All source files use LF line endings regardless of OS.
# This prevents the repository from being polluted with CRLF/LF
# noise (427 "modified" files with no real content change was the
# previous symptom).
#
# If a contributor needs CRLF in a specific file, override the rule
# on that path.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated resources — DataGen output, should never contain CRLF
*.json text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
